---
# Firebase AI Logic server prompt template: format pass (pass 2 of 2).
# Template ID: travel-format-v1-0-0 (Remote Config: ai_format_template_id)
# Single-turn template. Turns the findings of the research template into the
# TravelDetails JSON the app parses (lib/common/models/response/travel_details.dart).
model: gemini-3.8-flash
config:
  candidateCount: 1
input:
  schema:
    travel_information:
      type: string
      description: JSON-encoded trip details (airports, dates, nationality, purposes, locale).
      maxLength: 4000
    research_findings:
      type: string
      description: Plain-text findings produced by the research template.
# Structured output: must stay equivalent to TravelDetails.aiSchema
# (lib/common/models/response/travel_details.dart). test/common/ai/prompt_template_drift_test.dart
# fails when the property sets drift apart.
output:
  format: json
  schema:
    city(object):
      name: string
      country: string
      crowd_level: integer
      time?(object):
        departure_timezone: string
        arrival_timezone: string
        difference_in_hours: integer
      weather(array):
        date: string
        weather: string
        temperature: number
    required_documents(object):
      type(enum, Document the traveler needs for entry): [passport, e_visa, visa, id_card, other]
      message: string
      steps?(array): string
      more_information?: string
    currency(object):
      code: string
      name: string
      exchange_rate: number
      arrival_average_living_cost_per_day: number
      departure_currency_code?: string
      departure_average_living_cost_per_day?: number
    flight_options(object):
      cheapest(object):
        departure(object):
          airline: string
          departure_airport: string
          arrival_airport: string
          flight_number: string
          departure_time: string, Departure timestamp in ISO 8601 datetime format.
          arrival_time: string, Arrival timestamp in ISO 8601 datetime format.
          duration: integer, Total flight duration in minutes.
          price: number
          currency: string
          stops: integer
          layover_details(array):
            airport: string
            duration_minutes: integer
          more_information: string
        arrival(object):
          airline: string
          departure_airport: string
          arrival_airport: string
          flight_number: string
          departure_time: string, Departure timestamp in ISO 8601 datetime format.
          arrival_time: string, Arrival timestamp in ISO 8601 datetime format.
          duration: integer, Total flight duration in minutes.
          price: number
          currency: string
          stops: integer
          layover_details(array):
            airport: string
            duration_minutes: integer
          more_information: string
        booking_url: string
      comfortable(object):
        departure(object):
          airline: string
          departure_airport: string
          arrival_airport: string
          flight_number: string
          departure_time: string, Departure timestamp in ISO 8601 datetime format.
          arrival_time: string, Arrival timestamp in ISO 8601 datetime format.
          duration: integer, Total flight duration in minutes.
          price: number
          currency: string
          stops: integer
          layover_details(array):
            airport: string
            duration_minutes: integer
          more_information: string
        arrival(object):
          airline: string
          departure_airport: string
          arrival_airport: string
          flight_number: string
          departure_time: string, Departure timestamp in ISO 8601 datetime format.
          arrival_time: string, Arrival timestamp in ISO 8601 datetime format.
          duration: integer, Total flight duration in minutes.
          price: number
          currency: string
          stops: integer
          layover_details(array):
            airport: string
            duration_minutes: integer
          more_information: string
        booking_url: string
    tax_information(object):
      has_tax_free_options: boolean
      tax_rate: number
      refundable_tax_rate: number
      tax_refund_information?: string
    spots(array):
      place: string
      description: string
      requirements?: string
    travel_plan(array):
      date: string, Travel day as YYYY-MM-DD or ISO 8601 datetime. Date-only values are normalized to 00:00:00Z. Datetime values must include timezone/offset.
      events(array):
        name: string
        time: string
        location: string
        description: string
        requirements?: string
    recommendations(array): string
---

{{role "system"}}
Format given findings into TravelDetails JSON matching schema exactly.

The input has two parts: the trip details as JSON and the research findings as plain text. Use only information that is present in the research findings. Do not add facts of your own and do not change numbers.

Rules:
- Return a single JSON object and nothing else: no markdown fences, no explanations.
- Use the key names, types and nesting of the schema exactly.
- Dates and times use ISO 8601. Flight times include a timezone offset. Travel plan dates are YYYY-MM-DD.
- Flight duration is an integer number of minutes.
- crowd_level is an integer percentage from 0 to 100.
- required_documents.type must be one of the allowed values of the schema.
- exchange_rate is how many units of the arrival currency one unit of the departure currency buys. The departure living cost is in the departure currency and the arrival living cost is in the arrival currency.
- Use null for optional fields whose information is missing from the findings.
- Write all text values in the language given by the locale field of the trip details.

{{role "user"}}
User Input:
{{travel_information}}

Research Findings:
{{research_findings}}
